---
const personalImageAlt = "Diego Robredo";
import { SOCIAL_LINKS } from "@/utils/constants";
import ProfessinoalLink from "@/components/ProfessinoalLink.astro";
---

<article
  class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-8 text-gray-300 md:flex-row"
>
  <div
    class="order-2 md:order-1 [&>p]:mb-4 [&>p>strong]:text-yellow-100 [&>p>strong]:font-normal [&>p>strong]:font-mono text-pretty"
  >
    <p>
      Hello! My name is <strong class="font-bold">Diego Robredo</strong>, and
      I'm passionate about software development, especially in <strong
        >JavaScript</strong
      >! I've always loved puzzles and logic games. For me, programming
      challenges are just another form of entertainment, which is why I love
      coding and tackling new challenges!
    </p>

    <p>
      In addition to developing Frontend applications in my daily work, I've
      also started a small startup called <strong
        ><a
          class="personal-link"
          href="https://www.ohlive.app/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer">Ohlive</a
        ></strong
      >. It's an app for viewing furniture in Augmented Reality. It's a concept
      that's hard to explain but very easy to understand when you see it in
      action.
    </p>

    <p>
      If you're interested in my profile or the projects I've worked on and want
      to learn more or propose a new challenge, feel free to <strong
        ><a class="personal-link" href="mailto:drobredo@gmail.com">contact me</a
        ></strong
      >! I love always thinking about new challenges and opportunities!
    </p>
  </div>

  <img
    src="/profile.webp"
    alt={personalImageAlt}
    class="order-1 object-cover w-64 p-1 md:order-2 rotate-3 lg:p-2 aspect-square rounded-2xl bg-yellow-500/5 ring-1 ring-white/20"
    style="object-position: 50% 50%"
  />
</article>

<style>
  .personal-link {
    position: relative;
  }
  .personal-link:after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    bottom: -1px;
    width: 0%;
    height: 2px;
    background-color: #fef9c3;
    transition: width 0.4s ease;
  }

  .personal-link:hover:after {
    width: 100%;
  }
</style>
